"data-caption=\"Ovo je natpis\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    "
"<li><code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-caption=\"Drupalov ples\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    <li><code>&lt;blockquote data-caption=\"Dries "
"Buytaert\"&gt;Drupal je sjajan!&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code></li>\n"
"    "
"<li><code>&lt;code data-caption=\"Hello world na "
"JavaScript-u.\"&gt;alert(\"Hello "
"world!\");&lt;/code&gt;</code></li>\n"
"</ul>"

