"href=\"@drupal_slack\">Slack</a> or <a "
"href=\"@drupal_chat\">DrupalChat</a>. When you’re looking for a "
"solution to a problem, go to <a href=\"@drupal_support\">Drupal "
"Support</a> or <a href=\"@drupal_answers\">Drupal Answers on Stack "
"Exchange</a>."
msgstr ""
"Potražite podršku i razgovarajte sa Drupal zajednicom na <a "
"href=\"@drupal_slack\">Slack</a> ili <a "
"href=\"@drupal_chat\">DrupalChat</a>. Kada tražite rešenje za neki "
"problem, posetite <a href=\"@drupal_support\">Drupal podršku</a> ili "
"<a href=\"@drupal_answers\">Drupal Answers na Stack Exchange</a>."

