"Users need to be assigned <a href=\"@href\">Edit webform variants</a> "
"permission to be able create and manage variants."
msgstr ""
"Korisnicima je potrebno dodeliti dozvolu <a href=\"@href\">Uredi "
"varijante web-obrazaca</a> kako bi mogli da kreiraju i upravljaju "
